# Conversation rows' change events applied by the list's own model (the Superhuman pass, phase
# B; docs/superhuman/conversations.md): random new conversations, replies (the user's in Sent
# too), batches, flag changes and removals through a scratch store of their own, each event
# applied to models of three conversation views (Inbox; Inbox, unread; All Inboxes, starred),
# moves told GTK at once in one model and row by row in its twin. After every step each model
# equals its view read fresh from the store, row for row, sections included. Every message is
# fictional.
# Run: tools/headless.sh 61 target/debug/pronto --self-test tests/selftest/list-replay.sealwax-test

desktop tiling
resize 1024 700
list-replay 6 150
